        <mxCell id="flow-desc" value="1. User submits code via Frontend&#xa;2. Main Backend receives submission&#xa;3. Main Backend calls Judge Service&#xa;4. Judge Service compiles &amp; runs in Sandbox&#xa;5. Results returned to Main Backend&#xa;6. Main Backend saves results to RDS" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="vpc">
